{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Sally forth, Malathor! Do battle, and return to us victorious!\"\nSounds of buzzing can be heard around the area, growing louder and louder while Roy is grinning, as swarms of insects rise from the overgrown plants and target redcoat after redcoat. Unlikely to be enough to drop all of them, but enough to cause enough disarray and freakout among the ranks for easier picking by Grimlock, rebels, and Sab who's making even more raisins between moments when she's loading her blunderbuss with a menacingly innocent smile.\n(guess who picked Infestation as one of his druid cantrips)","created_at":"2021-08-26T04:30:44.704000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880308260769521664","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
